<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
jesd_stub.ipx

IP catalog index for the JESD-side stub component used by
ip/dac_subsys/dac_subsys.qsys. Quartus's recursive IP_SEARCH_PATHS
glob (../../ip/**/*) discovers _hw.tcl files at one nesting level
deep but the project-local IP catalog cache requires an explicit
.ipx entry for components nested two levels under the search root
(here: ../../ip/dac_subsys/jesd_stub/). Without this file the
component is found at top-level qsys-script time (Stage 3 worked)
but not during per-instance sub-qsys-generate invocations
(quartus_ipgenerate Stage 4 fails with
"Component type jesd_stub is not in the library").

Remove this file in Stage 6 alongside jesd_stub_hw.tcl when the
JESD GTS Subsystem replaces the stub.
-->
<library>
  <path path="jesd_stub_hw.tcl" />
</library>
